Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:29.26,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:32.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:34.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:35.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:37.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.27,0:21:39.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是骑士啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:47.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？我什么都没做...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.05,0:21:54.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:58.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:09.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:09.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}飞翼愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:12.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 请试着跟我一起跳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:49.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我想为阿翼办一场欢迎派对 你们觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.96,0:23:50.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要的要的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.92,0:23:52.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要做些什么菜？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.46,0:23:55.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,说到派对美食 当然是烧鲷鱼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:23:57.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？烧鲷鱼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:23:59.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:23:59.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.21,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,唔唔唔！回忆中的菜是什么味道的!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:32.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:38.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:43.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:51.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:56.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:01:00.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.74,0:01:02.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:06.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:11.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:13.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:17.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:21.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:25.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:25.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:27.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:27.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.41,0:01:32.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:37.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:42.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:47.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:50.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.41,0:01:58.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:29.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.67,0:22:34.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能实现梦想与心愿的蔚蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.40,0:22:37.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打开心中的麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.01,0:22:38.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:41.20,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.66,0:22:44.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.12,0:22:46.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能与你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.08,0:22:48.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打开心灵+门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.83,0:22:51.54,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已经激动到势不可挡!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:53.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:55.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:02.44,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}还是那条街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:08.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那里 这便是奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.27,0:23:10.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:14.99,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都过来！传开这韵律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.99,0:23:19.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵起手 心连起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:25.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用温暖的关怀 培育出的勇气 是无穷无穷的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.42,0:23:29.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,积极的图标是标记
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:33.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！这海阔天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.76,0:23:37.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们展开翅膀 飞向蓝天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.46,0:23:38.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,连接起人与人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.85,0:23:41.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圆环！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
